# Backend API base URL — read at BUILD time by Expo (process.env.EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL).
# Only EXPO_PUBLIC_-prefixed vars are exposed to the app, and values are INLINED
# at build time: after editing this file you must restart with `npx expo start --clear`,
# a fast refresh is not enough.
#
# The /api/v1 suffix is required — the backend sets a global prefix.
#
# Pick the host that matches where you are running the app:
#   iOS simulator     http://localhost:5000/api/v1
#   Android emulator  http://10.0.2.2:5000/api/v1     (localhost = the emulator itself)
#   Physical device   http://<YOUR-LAN-IP>:5000/api/v1 (phone must be on the same Wi-Fi)
#
# Production:
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.suwexa.app/api/v1
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api/v1
